---
layout: minimal.dax
---
<div class="section" style="border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:24px"><div class="sec-head"><h2>Lab & Research.<br>Video proof, source, ownership.</h2><p>Research streams with YouTube proof. Optimized images & lite video. Direct commission via Fiverr only.</p></div>
<div class="grid" id="grid">
{% for post in pagination.items %}
<div class="card" data-group="{{ post.group | downcase }}">
<div style="font-size:10px;margin:10px 0">{{ post.badge }} • {{ post.group }} • {{ post.status }}</div>
<a href="{{ post.url }}"><img src="{{ post.image or metadata.image }}" alt="{{ post.title }}" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover"></a>
<h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title }}</a></h3>
<p>{{ post.description }}</p>
</div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="pagination" style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin:32px 0">
{% if pagination.prev_url %}<a class="btn" href="{{ pagination.prev_url }}">← Previous</a>{% endif %}
<span class="btn active">Page {{ pagination.current_page }} / {{ pagination.total_pages }}</span>
{% if pagination.next_url %}<a class="btn" href="{{ pagination.next_url }}">Next →</a>{% endif %}
</div>
</div>